            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "It depends on the battery capacity, the snow and the temperature, so there is no single honest number. Light powder on a short driveway goes much further than wet, heavy snow on a long one. Cold packs deliver less than warm ones. Plan on a spare pack for big storms, and check Toro's stated runtime for your specific kit as a best-case figure."
